## Quality Gate PR Merge Checklist

Before submitting a pull request that introduces or refactors architectural components, verify every baseline item:

- [ ] **Layer Separation Verified:** Repository package structure strictly mirrors Presentation, Domain, Data, and Core layers.
- [ ] **Unidirectional Data Flow:** State is modeled as immutable discriminated unions; UI dispatches explicit user intents.
- [ ] **Resilience Wrapper Active:** Remote HTTP calls handle offline scenarios and emit typed domain error states.
- [ ] **Zero Hardcoded Secrets:** API endpoints, client credentials, and environment flags use runtime configuration providers.
- [ ] **Hardware Enclave Storage:** SSO tokens and sensitive tokens reside in Android KeyStore or iOS Keychain.
- [ ] **Unit Tests Passing:** Automated test suites verify domain use cases with at least 80% branch coverage.




