## Quality Gate PR Merge Checklist

Before opening a pull request containing architectural changes, verify all mandatory criteria:

- [ ] **Clean Layer Separation:** Presentation, Domain, Data, and Core are organized into explicit packages or modules.
- [ ] **Inward Dependency Direction:** All dependencies point inward toward the Domain layer; Domain has zero dependencies on Data or Presentation.
- [ ] **Domain Unit Test Coverage:** All Use Cases and validation rules maintain at least 80% unit test coverage using mock repositories.
- [ ] **Resilience Protection:** All remote HTTP requests in repository implementations incorporate failure recovery and local caching.
- [ ] **State Immutability:** State models in ViewModels are exposed as read-only streams (`StateFlow` on Android, `@Published private(set)` on iOS, immutable React state).





