### Operational Edge Guarantees
* **Credential Isolation:** Mobile clients receive a restricted client secret that can only query flag evaluation for registered contexts, preventing administration token exposure.
* **Core Protection:** The proxy caches evaluated payloads in memory, shielding core databases from millions of polling mobile instances.
* **Offline Fallback:** Local encrypted storage caches evaluate flags instantly on cold start before any network roundtrip completes.

---

## Standard Configuration Parameters

Enterprise mobile applications must initialize Unleash clients using standardized parameters:

| Configuration Parameter | Standard Value | Operational Purpose |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `refreshInterval` | `15 seconds` | Background polling cadence to detect remote toggle updates. |
| `context.userId` | Authenticated SSO User ID | Enables sticky percentage rollouts and targeted user segmentation. |
| `context.appName` | Application bundle identifier | Segregates configuration sets per mobile binary target. |
| `context.environment` | `development` / `production` | Enforces environment segregation across test and live users. |

