* Release branches contain exclusively bug fixes, localization updates, and release metadata.
* No new feature development is permitted after a release branch is cut.

---

### Emergency Hotfix Flow
When a critical production defect requires an immediate patch:

<DiagramExpand title="EMERGENCY HOTFIX WORKFLOW">

```mermaid
