    Hotfix -->|"Deploy patch"| QA["Testing Validation\n(Rapid smoke test)"]
    QA -->|"Approved"| Split{"Dual-Merge Requirement"}
    Split -->|"1. Merge to Production"| ProdFix["master / prod\n(Tagged patch release v2026.10.1)"]
    Split -->|"2. Merge to Development"| DevFix["develop\n(Prevents regression in next release)"]

